  "ALL_TEXT": "18 INT. MINISTER'S HOUSE - DAY \nA goon runs past the opulent gates, stairs, hallway and \nenters a vast room which has the FOREST MINISTER, a man in \nhis 60s, with imposing presence and stature, lays his feet on \nSURESH. They are surrounded by the minister's goons, a woman \nsitting on a chair and watching TV, with the minister's LEAD \nGOON standing close to the FOREST MINISTER. \nFOREST MINISTER \nEkkada raa aa vigraham? \nFOREST MINISTER \nVaadekkada? \nSURESH \nTelidhu saar... \nLEAD GOON \nEkkada dorkatledu... \nSURESH \nSaar... nenu nijam \ncheptunaanu, paniki raadhani \naa moogodiki ichesaanu saar... \nnaa daggara ivvi tappinchi \ninkem leevu \nThe FOREST MINISTER keeps thinking. The TV in the background \ncontinues to show a program on a demigod/Baba type \npersonality. \nFOREST MINISTER \n(Loudly) \nAa sound tagginchu! Mimalni kaadhu, \naa bhakti channel petkunna aa donga \nbaabani okati kottaali \nThe TV's volume goes down \nLEAD GOON \nVeedeni em cheddham? Champeyanaa? \nThe FOREST MINISTER pauses. He glances at both the TV and \nSURESH. \nLEAD GOON \nEntanna alochistunnaavu.. \nFOREST MINISTER \nVeedini Baabani cheyyandi \nLEAD GOON \nBaabana? Enduku anna karchu? \nFOREST MINISTER \nKarchu janaalu chuskuntaaru, manaku \nkaavalsindhi moogodu. Vaadu ela \nuntaado manaki telidhu...Vaadu \nbayataki raavalante veedu \nvelugolooki raavali...mana \nnalladanaanni telupu ki \nmarchadaaniki yantram kaavaali... \nCUT TO:",
